{
  "_comment": "Boots (style pass 2): a boot shell over the shin and foot with a turned-down cuff at the top, a sole and a toe cap; the trousers above in the base layer. Layers never share a plane: the foot shell is 0.15 px wider than the shaft and the sole 0.15 px wider again; on the inner side every shell stops 0.05 px short of the hero's centre line.",
